{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;STAR FIRE&quot;\u00a0is a completely solo-developed indie game, so your feedback is very important to me. You can email me directly at <a href=\"mailto:243619756@qq.com\">243619756@qq.com</a> to share your thoughts!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;STAR FIRE&quot;</strong> is a classic side-scrolling shooter centered around intense boss battles. Defeat colossal enemies in beautifully hand-drawn worlds!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a magical cat-eared girl, journey through ancient enchanted lands to gather scattered star fragments. Traverse grasslands, forests, oceans, and snow-capped mountains to restore the lost stars to their rightful paths in the sky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fresh Hand-Drawn Art Style</strong><br>All in-game art assets are meticulously hand-painted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/551379871860268b757602b6315d695d.poster.avif?t=1756261841\" width=582 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/551379871860268b757602b6315d695d.webm?t=1756261841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/551379871860268b757602b6315d695d.mp4?t=1756261841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Satisfying High-Speed Combat</strong><br>Players nimbly control characters in fast-paced boss battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/4846fa6bf93b5c73653f6c1d9bf0c99c.poster.avif?t=1756261841\" width=582 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/4846fa6bf93b5c73653f6c1d9bf0c99c.webm?t=1756261841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/4846fa6bf93b5c73653f6c1d9bf0c99c.mp4?t=1756261841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Bullet Patterns</strong><br>Uniquely crafted bullet patterns adapt to each scene\u2019s visual style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/9043a8fed15eb379c43899809a08749b.poster.avif?t=1756261841\" width=582 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/9043a8fed15eb379c43899809a08749b.webm?t=1756261841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/extras/9043a8fed15eb379c43899809a08749b.mp4?t=1756261841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794670?t=1756261841","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/5eacd8aba8c6132b6b9874ac96486b40cbcaa569/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756261841","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/5761dfbe0dc835c94775ffcdaa0c15e5bdc767e6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756261841","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794670/5761dfbe0dc835c94775ffcdaa0c15e5bdc767e6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756261841","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"desc